  "body": "Although d5f415efc7216aa5f527f4d94262aef2fffed8f6 tried to define\r\nthe behavior for negative timeouts, it didn't match implementations\r\nand was reverted in 3716990e05b51850ef7d3c874142b83fe9dd0aa6.\r\nInstead a negative timeout should just be set to 0.\r\n\r\nTests: https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/pull/5380",
